---
description: Toggle switches always sit to the left of their label
alwaysApply: true
---

# Toggle layout

Put the switch control to the left of its label. Do this for every toggle, including new ones.

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<div class="toggle-row">
  <span>Track clicks</span>
  <button class="switch" role="switch"></button>
</div>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<div class="toggle-row">
  <button class="switch" role="switch" aria-labelledby="track-label"></button>
  <span id="track-label">Track clicks</span>
</div>
```

Put the label and helper in `.toggle-copy` so the helper sits directly underneath the label. Align the switch with the top of the label.

```html
<div class="toggle-row">
  <button class="switch" role="switch" aria-labelledby="track-label"></button>
  <div class="toggle-copy">
    <span id="track-label">Track clicks</span>
    <p class="hint">Helper underneath the label.</p>
  </div>
</div>
```
